{{Term/Store|Extra Stamina||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Added Effect]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 280|edition= Expanded Edition|year= 2018}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Guide|TotK Piggyback|page=402-403}}</ref>

==Overview==
[[File:TotK Extra Stamina Icon 2.png|left]]
Extra Stamina is an [[Added Effect]] in {{BotW}} and {{TotK}} that fully restores [[Link]]'s [[Stamina Wheel]] and provides him with extra yellow rings of [[Stamina]], which are consumed after his green Stamina rings run out. This extra Stamina is consumed on use, but it can be restored by reapplying the Added Effect. Link can have up to two rings of extra Stamina in {{BotW|-}}. In {{TotK|-}}, Link can have up to 2.4 rings of extra Stamina, but only two rings will be visible. The invisible Stamina will be consumed after Link's green Stamina runs out and before the two visible rings of yellow Stamina.

The following [[Material]]s impart Extra Stamina in {{BotW|-}} and {{TotK|-}}:

* [[Endura Shroom]]
* [[Endura Carrot]]
* [[Tireless Frog]]

